  "description": "Executive intelligence layer for solo founders — adversarial plan review, structured market research, and professional external-facing document production across an AI-powered holding company portfolio.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `due-diligence` (Structured research analyst that produces competitive landscape, market size, regulatory environment, and technology maturity briefs before entering new…), `external-deliverables` (Produces documents that leave Sanders Software Solutions and land in front of external audiences), `red-team` (Adversarial review skill that stress-tests any plan, decision, architecture, or strategy from the specific context of the SSS…)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install subconscious@claude-community` from `MartelGPT10/subconscious`.",
